<title>UK: Citibank plans bond theft report statement.</title>
<headline>Citibank plans bond theft report statement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank plans to make a statement sometime after 1300 GMT following a newspaper report of the reappearance of millions of dollars of bonds stolen from the U.S. bank years ago, a Citibank spokesperson said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Evening Standard in London on Monday reported City of London police believed the bonds which were currently resurfacing were part of a cache with a face value of $111 billion stolen by the Mafia from a wastepaper recycling company in New Jersey in the 1980s.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6784</p>
